WEBVTT

1
00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:31.916
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:35.708
Lord Krishna asked us to worship Him.

3
00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:38.083
Now in this verse, He tells us

4
00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:41.166
how that worship should be done.

5
00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:43.541
In this final verse of this chapter,

6
00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:46.500
Lord Krishna presents the
essence of all His teachings

7
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.083
and the supreme path

8
00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:50.583
to liberation – briefly.

9
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:51.583
This verse

10
00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:54.583
reflects the core spirit of the Bhagavad Gita,

11
00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:58.208
emphasising the simplicity and universal

12
00:00:58.208 --> 00:00:59.833
accessibility of devotion.

13
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:06.125
In this verse,

14
00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:09.125
Lord Krishna's teaching is deeply personal,

15
00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:11.250
yet universal.

16
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:15.750
He says – 'Fix your mind always on Me,

17
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:18.750
become My devotee, worship Me,

18
00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:21.791
and bow down to Me.'

19
00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:25.208
These four actions – contemplation, devotion,

20
00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:29.541
worship, and surrender – 
are the fundamental steps of bhakti.

21
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:32.083
Together they represent the complete

22
00:01:32.083 --> 00:01:35.458
offering of mind, heart, and body.

23
00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:37.166
When Lord Krishna says

24
00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:40.541
'man-mana,' meaning 'contemplate Me,'

25
00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:41.875
He invites us to centre

26
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:45.166
our thoughts on Him.

27
00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:47.958
This is not merely an intellectual exercise,

28
00:01:47.958 --> 00:01:50.875
but a heartfelt relationship.

29
00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:53.250
This contemplation is transformative.

30
00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.875
It turns the mind away from worldly distractions

31
00:01:55.875 --> 00:02:00.000
and toward Lord Krishna's sweet presence.

32
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.583
He then says –

33
00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:05.541
'bhava mad-bhaktah' – 'become My devotee.'

34
00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:09.916
He asks us to transform our
emotions into devotion.

35
00:02:09.916 --> 00:02:10.916
But devotion

36
00:02:10.916 --> 00:02:13.583
is not limited to rituals,

37
00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:15.958
rather it includes love for Lord Krishna

38
00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:19.250
and the development of trust.

39
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:20.583
'Mad-yaji,'

40
00:02:20.583 --> 00:02:22.833
meaning 'worship Me,' and

41
00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:24.416
'mam namaskuru,'

42
00:02:24.416 --> 00:02:27.875
meaning 'bow to Me' – through these, Lord

43
00:02:27.875 --> 00:02:29.875
Krishna reminds us

44
00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:33.125
that action too is important in devotion.

45
00:02:33.125 --> 00:02:35.958
Worship includes offering service,

46
00:02:35.958 --> 00:02:39.250
and bowing is the symbol
of humility and surrender.

47
00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.166
These outward acts of devotion,

48
00:02:41.166 --> 00:02:43.500
combined with inner surrender,

49
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.625
build a complete relationship

50
00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:47.208
with Lord Krishna.

51
00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:50.291
And to those who follow these practices,

52
00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:53.041
Lord Krishna gives the assurance –

53
00:02:53.041 --> 00:02:57.958
'mam evaishyasi' – 'you will come to Me' –

54
00:02:57.958 --> 00:03:01.125
they will become one with Him.

55
00:03:01.125 --> 00:03:02.750
By offering ourselves completely

56
00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.708
to Lord Krishna,

57
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:08.416
by surrendering our mind, heart, and body,

58
00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:11.458
we rise above the material world

59
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:13.041
and into the realm of infinite

60
00:03:13.041 --> 00:03:16.250
joy and peace we enter.

61
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.250
This verse

62
00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.000
is Lord Krishna's teachings' pinnacle,

63
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.666
shedding light on the transformative

64
00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:24.958
power of devotion and its capacity

65
00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:28.291
to overcome all obstacles.

66
00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:35.375
Is spirituality

67
00:03:35.375 --> 00:03:38.416
truly as complex

68
00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:42.250
as we make it?

69
00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.708
Think

70
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:46.916
of someone you deeply admire.

71
00:03:46.916 --> 00:03:50.708
You often think about them,

72
00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:53.333
are inspired by their work,

73
00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:57.000
try to follow their example.

74
00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.833
By clapping or cheering for them,

75
00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:03.458
you express your appreciation

76
00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:06.208
and toward their brilliance

77
00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:09.791
show a feeling of respect.

78
00:04:09.791 --> 00:04:14.541
Have you not often seen this happening?

79
00:04:14.541 --> 00:04:18.083
Then in just the same way,

80
00:04:18.083 --> 00:04:21.416
contemplate Me,

81
00:04:21.416 --> 00:04:26.416
love Me, worship Me, and bow to Me.

82
00:04:26.416 --> 00:04:29.333
This is the simple path of devotion.

83
00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:31.083
The difference between the two

84
00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:35.500
can be understood through their results.

85
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.541
When you contemplate another person,

86
00:04:39.541 --> 00:04:42.833
you receive momentary satisfaction.

87
00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:44.666
But

88
00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:47.333
contemplating Me

89
00:04:47.333 --> 00:04:48.833
your heart

90
00:04:48.833 --> 00:04:54.541
fills with eternal peace and joy.

91
00:04:54.541 --> 00:04:56.333
Spirituality

92
00:04:56.333 --> 00:05:00.500
is not to take anything away from your life,

93
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.791
but it is a path to redirect

94
00:05:03.791 --> 00:05:07.875
your energy toward the eternal.

95
00:05:07.875 --> 00:05:11.958
Offer your love toward Me

96
00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:15.208
and see how your life

97
00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:18.541
fills with deep fulfilment.

98
00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:22.791
When you connect with Me,

99
00:05:22.791 --> 00:05:25.208
then your life becomes filled

100
00:05:25.208 --> 00:05:26.916
with nectar.

101
00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:37.500
In family life, I see that spirituality

102
00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.083
is made too complex,

103
00:05:41.083 --> 00:05:42.541
which sometimes turns

104
00:05:42.541 --> 00:05:46.583
the new generation away from it.

105
00:05:46.583 --> 00:05:48.958
But devotion

106
00:05:48.958 --> 00:05:51.541
is truly very simple.

107
00:05:51.541 --> 00:05:53.666
Contemplate Me,

108
00:05:53.666 --> 00:05:55.708
love Me,

109
00:05:55.708 --> 00:06:00.000
whatever you have, whatever it may be –

110
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.333
offer it to Me

111
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:06.000
and bow humbly.

112
00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.333
That is all.

113
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:11.541
Often, to connect with Me,

114
00:06:11.541 --> 00:06:15.125
elaborate rituals are not needed.

115
00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:17.000
What matters is

116
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:21.875
the feeling behind it.

117
00:06:21.875 --> 00:06:24.208
Just as a mother

118
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:25.708
to her infant

119
00:06:25.708 --> 00:06:29.583
through a lullaby teaches life's first lesson,

120
00:06:29.583 --> 00:06:33.625
in the same way, in your home spirituality

121
00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:37.125
present it in a simple and sweet way.

122
00:06:37.125 --> 00:06:39.958
If you make devotion simple,

123
00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:42.208
instead of focusing only on rituals,

124
00:06:42.208 --> 00:06:44.916
on love focus,

125
00:06:44.916 --> 00:06:47.291
then your family members

126
00:06:47.291 --> 00:06:51.083
will naturally be drawn to it.

127
00:06:51.083 --> 00:06:54.291
Instead of just instructing them to chant,

128
00:06:54.291 --> 00:06:59.083
also show them how it fills your heart

129
00:06:59.083 --> 00:07:02.500
with peace.

130
00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.458
Prayers, instead of

131
00:07:03.458 --> 00:07:05.708
presenting as an obligation,

132
00:07:05.708 --> 00:07:11.166
share stories of My love instead.

133
00:07:11.166 --> 00:07:12.416
When you

134
00:07:12.416 --> 00:07:15.416
on the essence focus your attention,

135
00:07:15.416 --> 00:07:16.541
that is,

136
00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:20.750
to build a heartfelt connection with Me,

137
00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:24.458
then spirituality is no longer a burden,

138
00:07:24.458 --> 00:07:27.541
but becomes a joyful experience.

139
00:07:27.541 --> 00:07:28.958
This approach

140
00:07:28.958 --> 00:07:32.875
will not only nurture devotion, but

141
00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:35.708
in your family a stream of harmony

142
00:07:35.708 --> 00:07:39.916
and love will flow continuously.

143
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:48.208
The foundation of success is simplicity,

144
00:07:48.208 --> 00:07:52.250
not complexity, and lies in clarity.

145
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.250
This is the truth of the path.

146
00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.750
As an organisation leader,

147
00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:01.250
keeping processes simple for your organisation

148
00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:04.041
is extremely important.

149
00:08:04.041 --> 00:08:05.250
Notice

150
00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.125
how I

151
00:08:06.125 --> 00:08:09.458
have made the path of devotion simple.

152
00:08:09.458 --> 00:08:10.916
Contemplate Me,

153
00:08:10.916 --> 00:08:13.875
love Me, offer to Me,

154
00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:18.625
and bow humbly.

155
00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:20.166
At the workplace,

156
00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:22.916
when you simplify tasks

157
00:08:22.916 --> 00:08:26.041
and provide clear direction,

158
00:08:26.041 --> 00:08:27.541
then your organisation

159
00:08:27.541 --> 00:08:31.791
becomes filled with greater confidence.

160
00:08:31.791 --> 00:08:33.500
Just as a tree

161
00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.625
draws strength from its roots,

162
00:08:36.625 --> 00:08:41.416
in the same way an organisation
from its core principles

163
00:08:41.416 --> 00:08:46.750
and simple processes is built.

164
00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.083
When in the office

165
00:08:48.083 --> 00:08:50.458
there is unnecessary complexity,

166
00:08:50.458 --> 00:08:55.166
important energy is wasted.

167
00:08:55.166 --> 00:08:59.166
Simplicity promotes efficiency

168
00:08:59.166 --> 00:09:03.208
and encourages creativity.

169
00:09:03.208 --> 00:09:07.458
Just as a river finds its own path,

170
00:09:07.458 --> 00:09:08.458
in the same way

171
00:09:08.458 --> 00:09:11.083
when you to your employees clear

172
00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:14.833
goals and guidance you give,

173
00:09:14.833 --> 00:09:19.416
then they find the right way themselves.

174
00:09:19.416 --> 00:09:20.541
Simplicity

175
00:09:20.541 --> 00:09:24.208
enables people, without getting
lost in unnecessary detail,

176
00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:26.833
to give their best

177
00:09:26.833 --> 00:09:30.541
performance, just as

178
00:09:30.541 --> 00:09:33.791
a simple relationship with Me

179
00:09:33.791 --> 00:09:36.458
brings deep transformation.

180
00:09:36.458 --> 00:09:39.750
A simple work system helps people

181
00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:43.791
to achieve excellent results.

182
00:09:43.791 --> 00:09:44.750
When work methods

183
00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:48.833
are difficult, then confusion arises.

184
00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:51.375
If they are simple,

185
00:09:51.375 --> 00:09:54.916
then everyone easily understands them

186
00:09:54.916 --> 00:09:56.750
and within them, to complete the work

187
00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:59.208
their enthusiasm grows.

188
00:09:59.208 --> 00:10:02.250
By choosing the path of simplicity, you not

189
00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:05.125
only in your field of work success

190
00:10:05.125 --> 00:10:06.416
will find,

191
00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:10.083
but in every aspect of life

192
00:10:10.083 --> 00:10:13.875
peace and satisfaction you will experience.
